              "explanation": "Muqarnas are intricate 3D geometric ceiling vaults that look like stalactites or honeycombs. In the Alhambra's Hall of the Abencerrajes, over 8,000 individual cells create the illusion of infinite, dissolving space - a mathematical and spiritual achievement representing the Islamic conception of divine infinity."
