              "explanation": "The SEALS mnemonic covers: Serpentinata, Elongation, Acid colors, Limbo space (ambiguous depth), and Self-conscious style. Mannerists deliberately REJECTED accurate perspective and clear spatial depth - instead creating 'Limbo space' with crowded, confusing compositions where foreground and background blur together."
