                "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n            <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n            <text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"34\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text>\n            <rect x=\"150\" y=\"140\" width=\"800\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.1)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n            <text x=\"550\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">WHAT CHANGED BOTTICELLI?</text>\n            <text x=\"550\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">A preacher, a bonfire,</text>\n            <text x=\"550\" y=\"280\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">and a city in turmoil</text>\n            <text x=\"550\" y=\"315\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">1490s Florence</text>\n          </svg>",
                "caption": "Testing your understanding of Botticelli's late-life transformation"
